//! # Enemy actors and AI (`d_enemiesNP`)
//!
//! **What lives here.** This module reconstructs the enemy-actor half of REL
//! module 3, `d_enemiesNP`. It covers one hundred and thirty-nine clusters:
//!
//! 1. the module bootstrap and the global state-table registry
//!    ([`entry`], [`fn_80a00160`], [`fn_80a00180`], [`register_state`]);
//! 2. `StateID`-named state tables for seven first-pass classes
//!    (Goomba/Kuribo, BeansKuribo, Bomhei, Crasher, Kanibo, Kanon and Killer);
//! 3. the allocator/constructors for five of those classes;
//! 4. a small run of `daEnKuribo_c` per-frame state handlers plus one contact
//!    damage callback;
//! 5. eleven second-pass state tables (Buku, BaramakiGesso, BlackPakkun,
//!    BounceBall, CliffChikuwa, CoinFloor, CoinJugem, FixationIcicle, GuraRock,
//!    GuraYuka, JimenFPakkun) and their five constructors;
//! 6. the `0x80A05...` record-chain/sampling helper cluster used by the Buku
//!    block;
//! 7. nineteen third-pass state tables (Coin, FireSnake, Puku, Hanachan,
//!    JumpPuku, Keronpa, LiftZenToge, ManholeChoropu, OnewayGate, PataKuribo,
//!    Pata, Redcoin, RotBlock, RotarionGhost, SakasaTogezo, TogeTekkyu,
//!    Togezo, BlockHelp, Wrturn), eight of their constructors, and three
//!    animation/damage responders;
//! 8. the six final state tables (Gabon, HimanBros, Icicle, LiftRotHalf,
//!    RailPolyChild, SanboEl), their six constructors, and the fourteen
//!    per-frame handlers of the `daEnGabon_c` actor plus two `LiftRotHalf`
//!    transform helpers;
//! 9. the wave-6 `daEnPata_c` per-state handler/collision cluster and the
//!    adjacent `pukupuku`-model actor's construction, transform, hitbox and
//!    probe helpers;
//! 10. the wave-7 `daEnPata_c` per-frame block (`0x80AE41C0..0x80AE5110`) and
//!    the `daEnCoin_c`/coin-family block
//!    (`0x80A41DC0..0x80A43F40`): state callback, target search, placement,
//!    model transforms, two constructors and one destructor;
//! 11. the wave-9 `penguin2`-model actor block
//!    (`0x80B00050..0x80B01350`): frame callbacks, hitbox setup, attack
//!    resolution, model placement, list queries and the state initialiser;
//! 12. the wave-10 continuation: the rest of the penguin state machine
//!    (`0x80B00C70`, `0x80B012E0` and `0x80B01DB0..0x80B02860`), the
//!    `block_snake_ice` rail actor (`0x80B03ED0..0x80B04880`) and two
//!    `daEnIcicle_c` helpers (`0x80A7F570`, `0x80A7F930`);
//! 13. the wave-11 base-enemy framework (`0x80A00280..0x80A00EB0`), the
//!    `daEnBaramakiGesso_c` fire-cannon helpers
//!    (`0x80A06F30..0x80A07BA0`) and three per-state callbacks;
//! 14. the wave-12 continuation: the `bakubaku`-model actor block
//!    (`0x80A03150..0x80A03B10`: state callback, `0x528`-byte constructor,
//!    vtable helpers and the model/animation binder) and the `daEnBuku_c`
//!    per-state handler block (`0x80A03E70..0x80A05970`: grab-slot
//!    bookkeeping, animation selection, facing/chase logic, the `Swim`,
//!    `AttackSwim` and `SrcSwim` steps, and two state callbacks);
//! 15. the wave-13 `daEnGuraRock_c`/`daEnGuraYuka_c` lift block
//!    (`0x80A6C810..0x80A6E680`): both constructors, both model binders, the
//!    `Wait`/`Fall`/`Still` state callbacks and attitude helpers, the shared
//!    lift-tree sampling routine, and the small `guru` model actor;
//! 16. the wave-14 segmented-enemy continuation (`0x80A6E930..0x80A713B0`):
//!    the `guru` rotate-animation tail, the `0x868`- and `0x988`-byte chain
//!    actors' constructors, their ground probes, landing and body-contact
//!    callbacks, the per-segment render walk and the shared release thunks;
//! 17. the wave-15 continuation (`0x80A71820..0x80A744D0`): the chain actors'
