/// Coin spawn/placement update: grid probe, model transfer, target search and
/// state switch.
///
/// The function first copies the position and selects a vertical speed from the
/// byte at `0x80429D28`. It probes the collision grid at the quantised x and
/// `-z` cell (`0x80077810`). A zero probe means the coin is free: it is nudged
/// by `0x80B2C6D0`, its speeds are seeded, the model is transferred from
/// `0x80429DD0`, and it searches for a target with [`fn_80a42810`]. With a
/// target it binds the target ( [`fn_80a428b0`] ), runs the transform/hitbox
