/// Main per-frame handler for the penguin's walking/ice state.
///
/// Order of operations (all observed):
/// 1. advance the `+0x548` animation;
/// 2. if `+0x10BA` is set and `+0x588` reports a finished clip, replay the
///    idle animation and clear `+0x10BA`;
