///    walk/air combination suppresses it, then `0x800955F0`;
/// 5. query the physics block `+0x1EC` through `0x80072BC0`, align the pitch
///    with [`fn_80b00d70`], and either coast/decelerate or emit the moving
///    sound `0x1F6` and clear the turn flags;
