/// Places the rail model at the actor position plus a three-float offset.
///
/// The matrix is built through `0x801C0BD0`, committed to the `+8` holder, and
/// the holder's rotate/commit slots run with the constant `0x80B31A5C`.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80b041a0` at `0x80B041A0` (200 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80b041a0_FUN_80b041a0.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `owner` - rail actor; its position is at `+0xA4`.
/// * `offset` - pointer to three `f32` values added to the position.
