/// # Side effects
/// Writes a 60-byte matrix, three floats and calls the holder vtable `+0x14`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `owner` and `offset` must be readable; the matrix scratch is local.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the position offsets, matrix builder and holder calls are explicit.
