/// Copies the horizontal chase delta into the two velocity vectors.
///
/// The delta is `(+0x67C, +0x680) - (+0xAC, +0xB0)`: it is stored at
/// `+0x660`/`+0x664` and then at `+0x164`/`+0x168`. The words at
