/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a6cf40_FUN_80a6cf40.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `actor` - lift actor in the `Wait` state.
