// | Constructor | Size | Class vtable | Notes |
// |---|---:|---|---|
// | `0x80A6E4D0` (wave 13) | `0x5D8` | `0x80B4A870` | `guru`, single segment |
// | `0x80A6EE90` (wave 14) | `0x868` | `0x80B4ABA0` | segmented actor |
// | `0x80A70500` (wave 14) | `0x988` | `0x80B4B000` | segmented actor |
