/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a6f3b0_FUN_80a6f3b0.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `actor` - actor whose `+0x718` word is an object id.
///
/// # Returns
