/// Rebinds the walk clips, writes the per-segment constant and plays a
/// landing effect.
///
/// `0x80A71700` re-runs the walk binder, every segment's `+0x88` is set to
/// `7000.0`, and the attack index `+0x93C` is cleared. When the body id at
/// `+0x428` is non-negative the function picks a landing effect from the
/// class byte `+0x431`: ids below 4 use `0x800E20A0` (offsets `0.0`/`24.0`),
/// id `0x32` uses `0x800E23C0` with the REL constants `0x80B2DAD8`/
