/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a72eb0_FUN_80a72eb0.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `state` - state object; `0` is returned untouched.
/// * `mode` - release flag forwarded from the engine; `> 0` frees the object.
///
/// # Returns
/// `state`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Destroys the state object and may free it.
///
/// # Safety
