/// `daEnHimanBros_c` attack handler: three phases over `+0x360`.
///
/// Phase 1 waits for clip frame `4.0`, then asks [`fn_80a73f20`] for the
/// per-side hit object. A null answer falls through to phase 3; otherwise the
/// actor is linked into the effect (`effect+0x410 = *actor`, `+0x740 =
/// *effect`) and the phase becomes 2. Phase 2 resolves the latched target with
/// [`fn_80a73ed0`]; a missing target or the `29.0` clip frame marks it
/// (`target+0x414 = 1`) and moves to phase 3. Phase 3 waits until the clip
/// frame reaches `40.0` and enters `StateID_AttackEd`.
