/// `+0x684 == 1`, the `5.5` frame spawns the per-side hit object and links it
/// into `+0x740`/`+0x68C`. When the clip finishes, phase 2 enters
/// `StateID_Quake` and every other phase enters `StateID_JumpAttack`.
