/// Contact callback that records the other actor's character id.
///
/// This is the shorter sibling of [`fn_80a77540`]. For a touching actor in
/// state 1 or 2 it reads the character id through vtable `+0x6C`, queries
/// vtable `+0xE0`, stores the id at `+0x8A6` (or zero), mirrors it to `+0x8A7`,
/// sets the per-id byte at `+0x8A9` and arms `+0x8A0`. When `+0x874` is 1 it
/// also writes the `-2.0` speed into the other actor's `+0xEC`.
