/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `actor` - enemy that stores the bookkeeping block.
/// * `other` - actor that touched it; only states 1 and 2 are handled.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes five fields on `actor`, one speed word on `other` and may invoke two
/// virtual methods on `other`.
///
/// # Safety
/// Both actors and their vtables must be valid; the id is used as a byte
/// index into `+0x8A9`.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - every branch, store and virtual slot is explicit; the sibling
/// [`fn_80a77540`] corroborates the field meanings.
