/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a77760` at `0x80A77760` (192 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a77760_FUN_80a77760.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
