/// * `other` - collision record whose `+4` word is the touching actor.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes one per-id slot, one flag, and one speed word.
///
/// # Safety
/// Both records must have a valid actor pointer at `+4`; the id indexes the
/// `+0x894` halfword table.
