/// Walks up to five `+0x30` child links while a vtable predicate returns zero.
///
/// Each step reads the child at `+0x30`, calls vtable slot `+0x0C` on it, and
/// stops when that predicate is non-zero. If five consecutive children fail,
/// the search recurses on the next child.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a5afe0` at `0x80A5AFE0` (224 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a5afe0_FUN_80a5afe0.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `node` - first node of the chain.
