/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a61e60_FUN_80a61e60.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `actor` - actor with the speed at `+0xEC`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes `+0xEC`.
