/// the first five checks and then recurses; folding them into a loop is exact.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a6a450` at `0x80A6A450` (224 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a6a450_FUN_80a6a450.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `actor` - first node of the chain.
