/// Full collection: frees every rider, spawns the burst and retires the item.
///
/// The body first asks `0x80070B10` whether the collecting player is in the
/// carry state; when it is, the item releases up to four riders whose
/// `+0x2A78` handle resolves back to this actor.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a85ad0` at `0x80A85AD0` (340 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a85ad0_FUN_80a85ad0.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `actor` - item that was collected.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Calls the embedded owner at `+0x148`, sets `+0x390 = 1`, detaches up to four
/// riders, spawns `Wm_en_burst_s`, requests sound `0x259` and retires the item
/// with mode `1`.
