/// finish with `0x80064BD0`, look up `cloud_wait`, bind the pair to `+0x588`
/// with `0x801650D0`, attach the clip with `0x801651F0`, apply the `1.0` blend
/// through `0x80169F80` and close the holder with `0x800690E0`.
