/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a920d0` at `0x80A920D0` (276 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a920d0_FUN_80a920d0.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
