/// Air step: advances the drift, then chooses the target vertical speed and
/// applies the side flip.
///
/// The state word at `+0x274` decides the branch: with bit `0x3C000000` set
/// the target speed becomes `-0.8125`; with the airborne flag `+0x62E` clear
/// the current speed is halved, the target becomes `2.0` and the flag is set;
/// otherwise the speed is zeroed and the platform returns to
/// [`STATE_80B741B8`]. A side-shift mask `0x15 << side` then flips `+0x348`,
/// the vertical speed and the facing speed. The body ends with the
/// `0x80097170` ground probe and `0x80064F50(actor, 0)`.
