/// the `+0x1EC` animation/ground query. While that query reports zero the three
/// velocity words are cleared; otherwise `+0xEC` is reset, a four-step counter
/// at `+0x5D4` walks `+0x5DC` down by `0x100` (steps 0 and 1) or zeroes `+0xE8`
/// and `+0x5DC` (steps 2 and up, clamped at 4), the landing effect is spawned
/// while the counter is below 4, and the velocity is re-seeded from
/// `+0x20C..+0x214`. The tail probes the two side offsets of `0x8042C1A0` and
/// ORs both collision masks into `+0x274`.
