/// # Arguments
/// - `actor`: the `daEnKanon_c` actor, passed in `r3`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Moves the actor, writes `+0xE8`/`+0xEC`/`+0x5BC..+0x5C4`/`+0x5D4`/`+0x5DC`,
/// may spawn the landing effect, and ORs two probe masks into `+0x274`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `actor` must be the live actor.
