/// Toggles the door when player 2 presses the interaction button nearby.
///
/// The controller object is taken from the global pointer table at
/// `0x80377C88[param_3]`; its vtable slot `+0x20` is asked about button `2`.
/// When that succeeds and `target` is non-null, the actor's position is copied
