/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a149f0_FUN_80a149f0.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - actor whose facing byte at `+0x348` is set.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes one byte at `+0x348`.
