/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - actor with the two speeds at `+0xE8` and `+0xEC`.
///
/// # Returns
/// `(int)(0x80B2B0FC * max(|+0xEC|, |+0xE8|))`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// None.
