/// Prepares the ring sweep: zeroes the velocity triple, derives the sweep
/// interval and the per-frame angle step, and emits sound `0x2A9`.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80af3b40` at `0x80AF3B40` (168 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80af3b40_FUN_80af3b40.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - Actor; velocity at `+0xE8..+0xF0`, timer `+0x500`, step
///   `+0x788`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes the three velocities, `+0x500 = 32` and `+0x788 = 0x400`; plays
/// sound `0x2A9` at the actor position.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be writable and the effect manager mapped.
