/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80af3d60` at `0x80AF3D60` (524 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80af3d60_FUN_80af3d60.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
