/// Class-X contact handler: switches between the two idle clips and either
/// spawns a fresh instance or hands it to an existing carrier.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a20bd0` at `0x80A20BD0` (400 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a20bd0_FUN_80a20bd0.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
