/// * `this` - Actor; dismiss flags at `+0x60C`, owner at `+0x394`, clip
///   selector on the class vtable `+0xD4`, bytes `+0x689`/`+0x68A`,
///   `+0x68D`, `+0x694`, dispatch object at `+0x6EC`, carrier at `+0x6F8`.
///
