/// dismiss path (byte `+0x68D = 3`, byte `+0x694 = 0xFF`, [`fn_80a20b10`]).
/// Otherwise the owner's state object must answer the `0x80B6F868` test; the
/// one-byte mode from `0x800212C0` then picks clip `0x80352AF4` (mode 1, bytes
/// `2`/`0`) or `0x80352B34` (any other non-zero mode, bytes `1`/`1`), stops
/// the dispatch object, and either spawns through `0x80022600` or follows the
/// carrier through `0x80022080`.
///
/// # Safety
/// The `+0x394` chain and the class vtable must be valid; `this` writable.
///
/// # Confidence
/// medium - the guard, the two clip words, every store and both placement
/// calls are literal; the two stack structures are reconstructed from their
/// byte offsets, and the state identity test is inferred from the method pair
/// (vtable `+0x28` then `+0x14` against a descriptor word).
