/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a22710` at `0x80A22710` (260 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a22710_FUN_80a22710.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
