/// 1. find `':'` in `name` (`0x802E1C40(name, 0x3A)`); when found, skip it;
/// 2. fetch the object's name through virtual slot `+0x20`;
/// 3. find `':'` in that name and compare the two suffixes with `0x802E1AB4`.
///
/// The callee identities are inferred from the colon handling; the body is the
/// same as [`fn_80a05ba0`].
