/// Per-frame ground step: settles the two fixed segments, then the trailing
/// chain, and switches the actor out when [`fn_80b05620`] fires.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80b05df0` at `0x80B05DF0` (152 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80b05df0_FUN_80b05df0.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `actor`: the rail actor; the rail buffer is at `+0x2B1C`.
///
/// # Side effects
