// `Create`/`Move` state records, then three more dispose forwarders, the model
// binder, the spawn initialiser taken from the owner's spawn word, the anchor
// and speed helpers, the owner-driven state setter, the contact callback and
// the matrix/attractor pair.
//
// Field map of the `lift_zen_toge` actor:
//
// - `+0x148` clip holder initialised from the ten-record table at `0x80B57060`,
// - `+0x524`/`+0x540`/`+0x544` model holder, model record and clip holder,
// - `+0x550` animator sub-object driven by `0x800D77xx`/`0x800D78xx`,
