/// The half extents are the two constants at `0x80B2FE48` (`16.0`) and
/// `0x80B2FE4C` (`8.0`); the effect group byte at `+0x391` is shifted into
/// bits 16..23 of the flags word, and the low bit pair `5` plus the corner
/// index in bits 20..23 selects the four sub-effects.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80ab7e50` at `0x80AB7E50` (240 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80ab7e50_FUN_80ab7e50.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
