/// Four `0x80064610` effect spawns, each from a stack vector.
///
/// # Safety
/// `actor` must be readable through `+0x391`; the effect spawner must be
/// callable.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the four vectors, the four flag words and both constants are literal
/// (the constants were read from the REL data section).
