/// Three-phase timer step that returns "still waiting" as `1`.
///
/// Phase `0` arms phase `1` and returns `0`; phase `1` waits for the `+0x854`
/// countdown and then rolls a two-way random choice (`0x800B2EE0(2)`) to pick
/// phase `2` or back to phase `0`; phase `2` returns `1` and returns to
/// phase `1`.
