// ===========================================================================
// 53. Wave 73: the `0x80AF0000` bucket
// ===========================================================================
//
// Three collectible/object families are reconstructed here. All three are
// world-map actors: they receive their spawn word from the section prologue
// (`0x802DCD74`), own model holders in the `0x52x` range and switch state
// through the class vtable slot `+0xD4`.
//
// - `Wm_ob_redringkira` (`0x80AF0010..0x80AF0660`): the red-ring collectible.
//   The literal data names are `red_ring`, `Wm_ob_redringkira` and
//   `Wm_ob_redringget`. The object keeps four two-float player offsets at
//   `+0x688` (stride eight) plus the previous pair at `+0x6A8`, and gates the
//   players through the mask word at `0x80429CA8`.
// - The `obj_coin` red-coin collectible (`0x80AF0B70..0x80AF1F70`): the
//   `0x6A8`-byte object whose model binder loads `g3d/obj_coin.brres` and the
//   `obj_coin_red` node. Its frame step spawns the `Wm_ob_redcoinkira` effect
//   and then either drops an item (ids `0x23C..0x242`) or runs the event
//   branch that clears the collecting player's mask bit.
// - `block_roulette` (`0x80AF7CA0..0x80AF8200`): the roulette block's model,
//   glass and empty nodes, the frame-index to item-id table at `0x80B31508`
//   and the drop request built for `0x80022600`/`0x80022780`.
//
// Field map of the red-ring actor, as observed in the exports:
//
// - `+0x60` class vtable (slot `+0xD4` = set state), `+0x7C` render matrix,
// - `+0xAC..+0xB4` position, `+0xDC` scale vector, `+0x100..+0x104` the three
//   `u16` rotation angles,
// - `+0x348` side index used by the angle ramp, `+0x355` the same side as a
//   byte, `+0x394` state sub-object, `+0x500` angle-lock word,
// - `+0x544`/`+0x5C0`/`+0x5EC` animation and effect holders,
// - `+0x6C8` effect record copied from the `+0x544` matrix, `+0x6D4` the
//   per-frame angle step, `+0x6D8` the six-argument model binder sub-object,
// - `+0x688..+0x698` four two-float player offsets, `+0x6A8` their previous
//   values.
//
// Field map of the red-coin actor (`0x6A8` bytes):
//
// - `+0x60` class vtable `0x80B627A8`, `+0x524` model holder, `+0x540` model
//   record, `+0x544`/`+0x584` animation holders, `+0x5C0` collision object,
// - `+0x668` player index, `+0x66C` variant word (bits 4..5 of the matching
//   stage object's `+0x04` word), `+0x670`/`+0x672` phase and countdown, `+0x674` landing
//   count, `+0x676` animation index, `+0x678` the owning player byte,
// - `+0x67C..+0x68B` four active flags, `+0x68C..+0x69B` four item ids,
// - `+0x6A0` the "spawn effect" latch, `+0x6A8` the model effect handle.

