/// Reports whether a player is inside the red-ring actor's collection box.
///
/// The two words at the player's slot are the cached offsets written by
/// [`fn_80af02c0`]. The test is `|x| <= 16.0` and `|y| <= 24.0`; the export
/// expresses the second half through `countLeadingZeros(flag) >> 5`, which is
/// exactly the boolean negation of the strict `>` comparison.
