/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80af0230` at `0x80AF0230` (144 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80af0230_FUN_80af0230.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `actor`: red-ring actor.
/// - `player_index`: slot 0..3.
