/// Steps the red-ring actor's proximity/angle animation.
///
/// The `+0x544` and `+0x5C0` holders advance first. The `+0xDC` triple then
/// shrinks by `0.03515625` (`0x80B312B8`) until it reaches `0.0`
/// (`0x80B312A0`); while it is above zero the `+0x102` angle advances by
/// `+0x6D4`, and when the `+0x500` lock word is zero the step is re-armed from
/// the per-side byte table (`0x8042C1A0`) scaled by `0x300`. Once the triple
/// reaches zero the actor switches to the `0x80B77890` state record and
/// advances the `+0x394` object.
