/// Main per-frame step of the red-coin actor.
///
/// With no owning player (`+0x678 == 0xFF`) the body only stops the `+0x584`
/// holder and returns `0`. Otherwise it advances the per-player event counter
/// in the manager at `0x80429F10`, spawns the `Wm_ob_redcoinkira` effect eight
/// units above the actor, derives the animation index at `+0x676` from that
/// counter (clamped to `8`), and then either:
///
/// - index `8`: drops the large item (`0x800B3510`), finds the matching stage
///   object through `0x80162D50(0x1EF, cursor)`, derives the variant from that
///   object's `+0x04` word (`>> 4 & 3`), flushes the effect context, plays
///   sound `0x243` and runs the per-player pass [`fn_80af15b0`];
