/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80af1200` at `0x80AF1200` (764 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80af1200_FUN_80af1200.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `actor`: red-coin actor.
