/// Submits the roulette's item drop when the gate allows it.
///
/// The body asks the item id with [`fn_80af8000`] and `0x80022770` decides
/// whether the drop is blocked. When allowed it queries the player handle with
/// `0x80022390`, builds the same six-word request as [`fn_80af7e80`] and
/// submits it through `0x800226D0`, or through `0x80022780` with the handle.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80af8050` at `0x80AF8050` (256 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80af8050_FUN_80af8050.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `actor`: `block_roulette` object.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Submits a request through one of the two `main.dol` helpers.
///
/// # Safety
/// The actor's `+0x394` sub-object and the two helpers must be valid.
///
/// # Confidence
/// medium - every field and call is literal; the gate's meaning is inferred
/// from the early return.
