/// Advances the roulette's visible face on a nine-frame cadence.
///
/// When the `+0x7CC` countdown is zero, the body cycles the face index at
/// `+0x7D0` (`(index + 1) & 3`), re-arms the countdown with `9`, sets the
/// `+0x73C` holder frame from the four-float groups at `0x80B31528`
/// (selected by `+0x7C8` and the face index) and plays sound `0x276`. Otherwise
/// it just decrements the countdown.
