/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80af8150` at `0x80AF8150` (176 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80af8150_FUN_80af8150.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `actor`: `block_roulette` object with countdown `+0x7CC`, face `+0x7D0`
///   and variant `+0x7C8`.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes the countdown and face word, the holder frame and a sound event.
///
/// # Safety
/// The holder and the sound manager must be valid.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the masks, the table stride, the countdown value and the sound id
/// are literal.
