// constructor: it installs class vtable `0x80B533C0` and allocates exactly the
// `+0x614`/`+0x814`/`+0x914`/`+0x924` blocks the other bodies walk.
//
// The `0x80AA5ED0..0x80AA6270` run is the same class's death callback tail:
// two arm callbacks, three constant producers installed as the `DieFumi` /
// `DieFall` / `DieBigFal` extra words, a five-link chain walker, a name
