// `+0x394` the child/state sub-object, `+0x500` state timer, `+0x504`/`+0x508`
// /`+0x509` per-child flags, `+0x524` render-list holder, `+0x540` model
// holder, `+0x544` transform holder, `+0x584` animation holder, `+0x5BC` body
// animation, `+0x5E8` clip holder, `+0x614..+0x814` the 64-entry X/Y trail,
// `+0x814..+0x914` a 32-entry X/Y sample buffer, `+0x914..+0x924` the four
// child ids, `+0xA4E` light yaw, `+0xA50` timer, `+0xA52` pinch flag,
// `+0xA53` highest active child index, `+0xA54` saved child index,
// `+0xA55` explode countdown, `+0xA56` trail cursor.
