/// Walks the `+0x30` owner chain of the third skeleton.
///
/// Same five unrolled steps plus recursion as [`fn_80a50580`].
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a52780` at `0x80A52780` (224 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a52780_FUN_80a52780.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
