/// Writes the `+0x544` and `+0x550` animation-holder matrices from the actor
/// position and its `+0x55C` offset block.
///
/// Each half builds a three-float position, passes it through the vector
/// pre-transform `0x80064AF0(vector, 0, 1)` (no angle triple), converts it to
/// three `double`s for the matrix builder `0x801C0BD0` with the `+0x7C`
/// destination, then hands the matrix to the holder with `0x8016A170`, blends
/// the `+0xDC` animation with `0x8016A150` and clears the holder's weight with
