/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80b201e0_FUN_80b201e0.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `actor`: the `0x678`-byte actor; its position lives at `+0xAC`..`+0xB4`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Rewrites the `+0x7C` matrix twice, attaches it to both holders and calls
/// two animation methods per holder.
///
/// # Safety
/// `actor` must be a live object with both holders constructed.
