/// Retracts the holder when a neighbouring object enters one of two modes.
///
/// The neighbour's `+0x38C` byte selects the case: mode `1` requires the
/// `0x80056CF0(neighbour, 0x1C)` probe to succeed *and* `0x80056BD0` to
/// return `0`, mode `2` requires only the probe. The shared retraction tests
/// the actor's `+0x394` object against the descriptor at `0x80B794B8` through
/// the `+0x28 -> +0x14` virtual chain; on a positive answer it decrements the
/// `+0x568` counter and enters the `0x80B794F8` state.
