///   `_restgpr_25` epilogue call (`0x802DCDB8`); the image reads the actor from
///   the incoming `r3` (`lwz r0,0x6A8(r3)`) and returns the computed flag
///   directly.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `actor` - the actor whose `+0x6A8` word gates the scan; the incoming `r3`.
///
/// # Returns
/// The computed flag (`1` when all three slots count, else `0`).
