/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80b078c0_FUN_80b078c0.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `_callback` - unused first argument.
/// - `pair` - the collectible's two-word event record; `+4` is the actor.
/// - `other` - the touching actor's two-word event record; `+4` is the actor.
///
/// # Side effects
/// May write `+0x6C2` on the collectible.
