/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a10590` at `0x80A10590` (156 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a10590_FUN_80a10590.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
