/// Recomputes the two offset pairs of every segment from its target object.
///
/// Segment `+0xE0`/`+0xE4` and `+0x184`/`+0x188` become
/// `(base + offset) - target`, where the base pair is `+0x80`/`+0x84`, the
/// offsets are `+0x214..+0x220` and the target is the object at `+0x224`.
