/// - `this`: the world-map enemy. `+0x964 + axis*4` holds the target,
///   `+0x95C` the step, and `+0x8FC + axis*0xC` the current value.
/// - `axis`: `0..3`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes the stepped value back.
///
/// # Safety
/// `axis` must be below `4`; the blocks at `+0x8FC` and `+0x964` must be live
/// arrays.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the two branches, the step word and the clamp are literal.
