// `fn_80af5c60` is deliberately not translated: its export is dominated by
// paired-single `GQR` artifacts (`unaff_GQR0/3`, `ldexpf`, `CONCAT22`) and
// the angle scaling that feeds `0x80237C40`/`0x80237BD0` cannot be recovered
