/// side code stored at `+0x430`. The actor's `+0x90`/`+0x94` words plus the
/// constant `5500.0` are handed to `0x800954D0(actor, &vector)`; their roles
/// are not printed by the export. The player's combo counter at `+0x134` is
/// advanced through `0x80065B80` and clamped to `8`, and the record is
/// completed with one word from the `0x8042C1B0` side table, the three
/// `0x8042C2D0/D4/D8` globals, the two `0x80B2F778/F780` words and the
/// player's character type.
