// `0x80B3B568` holds the two `fState`-object vtables that `register_bomhei_states`
// passes as its fourth argument, `0x80B3B568`/`0x80B3B59C`, and their methods
// are [`fn_80a2ae10`], [`fn_80a2ae70`], [`fn_80a2b0b0`], [`fn_80a2b170`] and
