/// Per-frame step that saves the velocity triple, moves, and restores it.
///
/// The holder's `+0x1C` slot runs first, then `0x8006CD40(actor)`. The
/// `+0xE8`..`+0xF0` triple is copied to `+0x5E0`..`+0x5E8`, the ground test
