/// Derives the actor's heading from the two ends of its trail.
///
/// Lane 0 of `0x80B31FF8` is record `0`, lane 1 is record `63`, so the function
/// measures head minus tail (or tail minus head, per `+0x5CA`), mirrors the x
/// difference for the `+0x348` side, and stores the `0x801611C0` result in
/// `+0x100`.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80b10f80` at `0x80B10F80` (152 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80b10f80_FUN_80b10f80.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - the trail actor.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes the `+0x100` angle halfword.
///
/// # Safety
/// Both trail records must be inside `+0x5EC..+0x7EB`.
///
/// # Confidence
