/// Rebuilds and commits the actor's render matrix from its position, then
/// updates the attached node pair.
///
/// `0x8006CED0` snapshots the world position into three floats, the three
/// halfwords at `+0x100..+0x104` are copied into a rotation triple, and
/// `0x80064AF0` folds both into the matrix at `+0x7C`. The matrix is copied
/// into the `+0x3B4` holder, the holder's `+0xDC` local matrix is refreshed and
/// its virtual slot `+0x14` is called.
