/// Per-frame step of the split-container actor.
///
/// Runs the three base steps, then the two controller predicates that flip
/// `+0xEC` and clear `+0xE8`. State `1` blends `0.8` and scales `+0xEC` by
/// `-0.5` once the actor has stopped and the stick is released, state `2`
/// blends `0.6`, sets `+0x178 |= 7` and a `10`-frame `+0x500` timer, and
