/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80afb670_FUN_80afb670.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `actor`: the parent that owns `+0x528`.
/// - `child`: the actor whose `+0xAC + +0xD0` supplies the second side test.
/// - `count`: the target slot number from the other actor's `+0x18`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Calls the untranslated slot writers `0x80AFD500`/`0x80AFD550` on every live
/// child of kind `0x93`.
