/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a581e0` at `0x80A581E0` (176 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a581e0_FUN_80a581e0.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
