/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80b22e00` at `0x80B22E00` (228 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80b22e00_FUN_80b22e00.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `actor` - the `Wm_en_pakkun` actor.
