/// Rebuilds the `block_jump` matrix from the actor position and angles.
///
/// The position is rotated by the three `u16` angles (`0x80064AF0`), lifted by
/// `8.0`, turned into a matrix at `+0x7C`, then split into the pitch, yaw and
/// roll components. The matrix and the `+0xDC` scale vector are copied into
/// the `+0x6B8` model record and committed.
