/// Arms one player on a `block_jump` platform.
///
/// The `+0x38C` character id selects the branch. Id `2` sets the bits at
/// `+0x72E`, `+0x730` and `+0x734`; any other id sets `+0x72D`, `+0x72F` and
/// `+0x734`. Both branches then probe the player's ability handle with ids
/// `0x1C` and `0x2B` and set the `+0x731`/`+0x736` flags accordingly. The
/// handle is released at the end of the `mode == 1` path.
