/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80adc500` at `0x80ADC500` (112 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80adc500_FUN_80adc500.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `out`: the 12-word matrix buffer.
/// - `actor`: the parachute actor; its model record is at `+0x548`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes `out`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `out` must hold at least 48 bytes and the model record must be bound.
///
/// # Confidence
