///
/// When the `+0x394` sub-object reports state `0x80B76C28`, the character byte
/// `+0x38D` and the `+0x284` byte are set to `0xFF` and the actor switches to
/// `0x80B76CA8`. Otherwise a negative `+0x5EC` is re-armed with `240` frames,
/// the `+0x5C0` clip is restarted and the actor switches to `0x80B6FB68`.
