/// Collision responder: either re-arms the ground block or copies the contact
/// record into `+0x414`.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80b1ea50` at `0x80B1EA50` (420 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80b1ea50_FUN_80b1ea50.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `actor` - head actor; `+0x1EC` is the collision block, `+0x274` the
///   status flags, `+0x348` the side byte.
///
