// 96. Wave 115: the `larry`/`met_toge` demo actors and the bucket tail helpers
//     (0x80B0A8D0..0x80B0C0D0, 0x80B0E310..0x80B0EF00 and
//      0x80B0F4A0..0x80B0FF50)
//
// Three runs of the `0x80B00000` bucket:
