// * `0x80B0E310..0x80B0EF00` - the `larry` demo actor. `0x80B0E490` allocates
//   the `0x5C0`-byte object (vtable `0x80B68448`), `0x80B0E5E0` binds
//   `g3d/larry.brres` and resolves the `larry` node, `0x80B0E780` rebuilds the
//   matrix from the position/facing triple and submits it to the model holder
//   and the `+0xDC` reference, and `0x80B0E8C0`/`0x80B0EA10` bind the
//   `demo_battleA`/`demo_battleA_wait` clips. `0x80B0EEF0` is the constructor
//   of a `0x718`-byte sibling that installs the same `+0x524`/`+0x544`/
//   `+0x584` holder chain plus a `+0x5CC` animation holder and a `+0x604`
//   member with vtable `0x80B4C310`.
// * `0x80B0F4A0..0x80B0FF50` - the `met_toge` actor: the matrix rebuild, the
//   run-speed seed with the side flip, the destructor, the detach helper, the
//   `0x7F8`-byte constructor and the `g3d/met_toge.brres` binder that also
//   resolves the `met_toge_shell` node.
// * `0x80B0A8D0..0x80B0C0D0` - tail helpers of the same bucket: a deleting
//   destructor, the `0x4330` timer seed of the `+0x39C` word, the recursive
//   class-`0x99` search, the `0x528`-byte constructor, a big destructor that
//   resets four embedded holders, two forwarders and the `+0x9E0` overlap
//   timer.
//
// The literal names are the only identity evidence: `g3d/larry.brres`,
// `larry`, `demo_battleA`, `demo_battleA_wait`, `g3d/met_toge.brres`,
// `met_toge` and `met_toge_shell`. The neighbours deliberately left for a
// later pass are `0x80B0CD80`/`0x80B0CEB0` (a mutex pair
// `0x802DCD70`/`0x802DCDBC` whose arguments and return halves Ghidra prints
// without operands), `0x80B0D2A0`/`0x80B0D4D0`/`0x80B0D6E0`/`0x80B0D9A0`
