/// The word is converted to a double through the classic `0x4330` pair (the
/// high word is `0x43300000`, the low word is the value with its sign bit
/// flipped) and the `0x80B31DA0` bias is subtracted; the result is scaled by
/// `0x80B31D94`, stored at `+0x99C`, divided by `0x80B31D84` into `+0x9A0`
/// and divided again by `0x80B31D98` into `+0x9A4`.
