/// `0x80B2C5E8` speed from the `0x802DE514` angle class.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a3fff0` at `0x80A3FFF0` (480 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a3fff0_FUN_80a3fff0.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
