/// - `this`: the `0xA95`-state actor; trample counter `+0x740`, animation
///   `+0x1EC`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes `+0x740`, `+0xEC`, `+0xE8`, `+0xF4`, `+0x11C`, plays sound `0x23A`
/// on the first trample, and runs the sound/effect tail plus the motion tail.
///
/// # Safety
