/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a9f460` at `0x80A9F460` (456 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a9f460_FUN_80a9f460.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Removed: the modelled `_restgpr_27` epilogue call (`0x802DCDC0`). The
///   `_savegpr_27` prologue (`0x802DCD74`) was never modelled; the four
///   arguments are the incoming `r3`..`r6` (`mr r27,r3`, `mr r28,r4`,
///   `mr r29,r5`, `mr r30,r6`).
