/// - `actor`: `daEnKanon_c` actor (incoming `r3`).
/// - `contact`: contact record whose `+0x90`/`0x94` words hold the point (`r4`).
/// - `record`: collision event whose `+0x4` word is the contacting actor (`r5`).
/// - `variant`: `0` selects `0x8009F5F0`, any other value `0x8009F690` (`r6`).
///
/// # Side effects
/// Builds the flash record, spawns one effect, writes `+0x844`/`+0x868` and
/// plays one sound.
///
/// # Safety
/// The contact record, the attacker's vtable and the sound manager must be
/// valid.
