/// `daEnKanon_c` contact flags and frame tail.
///
/// The `+0x1EC` block drives the flag byte: a contact sets bit `1`, the
/// `0x80072CB0` overlap tests set bit `4`, and the two results are or-ed into
/// the `+0x274` mask word. The side is chosen by comparing `+0xAC - +0x238`
/// against the zero word; the table at `0x8042C1A0` supplies the two signed
/// probe offsets. `0x80AA0080` closes the step with the `0x80B2F2E0` wide
/// blend.
///
