///
/// # Returns
/// Always `1`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One virtual call on `actor + 0x394`, [`fn_80afd210`], [`fn_80afcdd0`],
/// `0x8008C2C0` and possibly `0x80064F50(actor, 0)`.
///
/// # Safety
