/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80afd060` at `0x80AFD060` (272 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80afd060_FUN_80afd060.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `actor`: the sanbo actor.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Initialises the three global offsets once and writes the matrix at `+0x7C`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `actor` must be writable; the globals are process-wide.
