/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `actor`: the sanbo actor.
/// - `side`: stored into the `+0x348` side byte.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes `+0xE8`, `+0xEC`, `+0xF0`, sets one of the `+0x120` bits `0x10`/`0x20`,
/// clears `+0x5D0` and switches state through vtable slot `+0xD4`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `actor` must be live with a valid vtable.
