///
/// # Arguments
/// - `rate`: `f64` blend rate, truncated to `f32` for `+0xEC`.
/// - `actor`: the sanbo actor.
/// - `code`: stored at `+0x5D4`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes `+0xE8`, `+0xEC`, `+0x5D4`, `+0x5D8` and switches through `+0xD4`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `actor` must be live with a valid vtable.
