/// Seeds the interpolation counters from a source point and enters a state.
///
/// `+0x5F4`/`+0x5F0` hold the full count and its remaining ticks; `+0x5FC`/
/// `+0x5F8` hold the same for the vertical component, scaled by `3/4` with
/// truncation toward zero.
