/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `actor` - `bubble` actor.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes `+0xB44`, `+0xB48`, `+0xB4C`, commits the three matrices and patches
/// the node colour/alpha of `+0x58C` and `+0x5CC`.
