///   first argument of the two helpers.
/// * `holder` - model/matrix holder (`+0x58C` or `+0x5CC`).
/// * `mode` - attribute id handed to both the colour reader and writer.
/// * `patch` - replacement for the high colour byte.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes one packed colour word per node.
///
/// # Safety
/// `holder` must be initialised and the node payload chain must be valid.
