/// Main per-frame step of the goal-set actor.
///
/// A frame-counter gate and a random stamp choose between the timed capture
/// path (180-frame entry timer, per-player attach through [`fn_80a68170`], the
/// countdown and the [`fn_80a682a0`] band scan) and the quick path (30/90-frame
