/// Spawns one killer shot into a free child slot.
///
/// The actor comes from the `0x802DCD74` prologue. The `+0x500` timer and the
/// global `+0xBCB` byte both suppress the step; `+0xE1C` is a retry delay.
/// When the scene band test passes, a free `+0xB44` slot is claimed and the
/// shot position is built from the actor x/y, the `0x80B2F8E8` height row and
/// the slot index (scaled by `16.0` and negated), with mode `1` snapping z to
/// `+0xB4 - 16.0` and lifting y by `16.0 * +0xE20 * +0xE0`. The spawn word
/// packs the side (`0x12` for mode 1, `2` otherwise), the slot in bits 8..12
/// and the spawn flags in bits 20..21. On success the shot is linked into the
/// slot, sound `0x1C1`/`0x1BD`/`0x1C4` plays and the left/right
/// `Wm_en_mgkillershot_*` effect is raised.
