/// 9-cell grid spawn.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80ad5760` at `0x80AD5760` (500 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel_d_enemiesNP/export/80ad5760_FUN_80ad5760.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: the spawned grid actor; `+4` is the task word, `+0x564` the grid
///   parameters, `+0x4C2C`/`+0x4C2D` the column/row counts, `+0x6DC` the cell
///   emitter and `+0x6D0..+0x6D8` the copied three-word block.
///
/// # Returns
/// `1`, always.
