/// # Side effects
/// Writes `+0xB4 = -256`, installs the five nibble parameters, clamps both
/// counts to at least 2, derives the two grid extents, runs the three spawn
/// helpers and the `+0x280` vtable call, writes the `0x80B3096*`/`0x80B30970`
/// offsets, copies the `0x80B5C22C` block and emits the cell record through
/// `0x800BFC60`.
///
