/// Huhu per-frame step with the direction sound.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80acc520` at `0x80ACC520` (492 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel_d_enemiesNP/export/80acc520_FUN_80acc520.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: the Huhu actor; `+0xAC` is the position x, `+0x102` the swing
///   angle, `+0x348` the direction byte, `+0x5D0` the swing table, `+0x5D4` an
///   animation counter and `+0x548` the model holder.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Requests sound `0x1E7` at the actor position, writes the swing entry,
/// clamps the x floor to 264 while the frame runs and restores the original
/// value afterwards, and raises one of the three state tokens based on the
/// sibling predicates.
///
/// # Safety
/// The sound manager at `0x80429D5C`, the `+0x548` vtable and the `+0x1EC`
/// object must be live.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the clamp/restore pair, the counter arm and all three token branches
/// are literal.
