///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a0bd20` at `0x80A0BD20` (460 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel_d_enemiesNP/export/80a0bd20_FUN_80a0bd20.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
