/// Two-actor push/bounce effect.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a2bc50` at `0x80A2BC50` (456 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel_d_enemiesNP/export/80a2bc50_FUN_80a2bc50.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: the pushing actor; `+0x6C4` is its floor height and `+0x60` the
///   class vtable carrying the `+0x294`/`+0x298`/`+0x29C`/`+0x2A0`/`+0x2B8`
///   slots.
/// - `other`: the contacted actor; `+0x38C` is its class byte, `+0x1090` its
///   variant and `+0x60` its vtable (`+0x3FC` receive slot).
///
/// # Side effects
/// Pushes this actor, normalises the horizontal delta into a `Vector3`,
/// applies the `+0x2A0` height scale and the `+0x294` speed scale, clamps the
/// height to the `+0x29C`/`+0x298` limit and hands `(f1 = height, f2 = delta x)`
/// to the contacted actor's `+0x3FC` slot with `r4 = 1`, `r5 = 0x806B4F40`,
/// `r6 = 0`.
///
/// # Safety
/// Both actors and both vtables must be live.
