/// While `+0x500 == 0` and `flag == 0`: when `+0x528` is zero it loads a fresh
/// position from `0x80B19E30(this)` and re-arms the timer to `0x80`, otherwise
/// it decrements the timer.
///
/// # Safety
/// `0x80B19E30` must be callable with `r3 = this`.
///
/// # Confidence
