/// Tests the four player slots against a `256 x 160` proximity box.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a368b0` at `0x80A368B0` (244 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a368b0_FUN_80a368b0.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: the actor whose `+0xAC`/`+0xB0` position is the box centre.
///
/// # Returns
/// `1` when at least one active player slot is within the box, else `0`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// None beyond the four `0x8005F900` queries.
///
