/// Binds the `run` clip and starts it at a random frame offset.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a35370` at `0x80A35370` (232 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a35370_FUN_80a35370.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: the actor; `+0x540`/`+0x544`/`+0x584` are the model, model record
///   and animation holder, `+0x5AC` is the total frame count.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Attaches `run`, sets the rate and blend to `1.0` and seeks to
/// `(s32)(+0x5AC) / 10 * rand(10)` (the quotient, not the raw frame, is the
/// multiplier).
///
/// # Safety
/// The three holders must be live.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the clip bind, both `1.0` arguments and the signed divide-by-ten
/// magic sequence are literal; the `0x800B2ED0(10)` value is used as a `0..9`
/// count because only its range is provable.
