/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a1e2a0` at `0x80A1E2A0` (716 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a1e2a0_FUN_80a1e2a0.c`
