/// Impact/death step of the `block_cloud` actor: state tokens, splash effect,
/// sound and the effect-row reset.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a1fa70` at `0x80A1FA70` (412 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a1fa70_FUN_80a1fa70.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: the actor; `+0x394` the state holder, `+0x68A`/`+0x689` the mode
///   bytes, `+0x788`/`+0x7A8` the effect-row arguments, `+0x794` the effect
///   position block, `+0xAC..+0xB4` the actor position.
///
