/// Returns unless the `0x80B6F7D8` state query succeeds and the controller mode
/// is non-zero. Then dispatches the `+0xD4` class slot for mode 1/other, emits
/// `Wm_en_blockcloud` at `+0x794`, plays cue `0x27A`, resets the effect row,
/// writes `+0x7AC = 4` and emits the splash through `0x80A933E0` with the
/// variant nibbles of `+4`.
