///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: the head of a `+0x30` child chain.
///
/// # Returns
/// The node whose immediate child returned non-zero, or the result of the
/// sixth-descent recursion.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Five vtable slot `+0xC` dispatches per call level; the receiver is always the
/// child, never the returned node.
