///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80ade3a0` at `0x80ADE3A0` (136 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80ade3a0_FUN_80ade3a0.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
