/// Counts the `+0x6C0` timer down and retires the actor when it reaches zero.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a2d660` at `0x80A2D660` (132 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a2d660_FUN_80a2d660.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: actor; `+0x1EC` is the shared body object, `+0x6C0` the `u16`
///   countdown, `+0x6C4` the path-update gate, `+0x534` the path sub-object and
///   `+0x366` the cleared byte.
