/// `0x80B0D0E0` reset and stores `16` into `+0x9E2`.
///
/// # Safety
/// Both callees and the actor must be live.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the probe is a plain call returning `f1`; the predicate is `CR0.LT`
/// extracted by `mfcr` + `rlwinm 1,31,31`, which the explicit `<` reproduces
/// (unordered also yields 0).
