/// Three-band altitude state machine.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a6efb0` at `0x80A6EFB0` (100 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a6efb0_FUN_80a6efb0.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: actor; the altitude delta is `+0xB0 - +0x850`.
///
/// # Returns
/// `1` below `56.0`, the tail call's value in the middle band, `0` above.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes `0`, `1` or `2` to the `+0x860` state word; the middle band also
/// tail-calls `0x800B2EE0(2)`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `this` must be live.
///
/// # Confidence
