/// Follows the `+0xAE4` owner either attached (mode `1`) or in an ellipse.
///
/// Mode `1` copies the owner angle into `+0xADE`, writes
/// `+0x104 = +0xAF0 + owner_angle`, places the actor at
/// `owner + radius*(cos, sin)(owner_angle + +0xAF2)` minus the `+0xD0` bias and
/// calls the owner callback `0x80707400`. Every other mode writes
/// `+0x104 = owner_angle + 0x4000` and places the actor on the ellipse
/// `(+0xACC, +0xAD0)` rotated by that angle.
