// wave 145 and is not repeated); rank 6 (`0x80A22820`) is documented as skipped
// in `docs/COVERAGE_WAVE146_ENEMIES.md`. The remaining seven bodies are
// `0x80A30000` bucket rows of the `brakesmoke` / `Choropoo` neighbourhood and
// two small mode dispatchers.
//
// The section keeps the wave-146 data words in one block so the offsets quoted
// in the bodies stay readable. Every float was read out of
// `work/rels/elf/d_enemiesNP.elf` at the address shown.

