///   burst timer, `+0xDCA` the state id, `+0xDCC` the splash timer, `+0xDD6` the
///   hold latch, `+0xDF0` the bob angle, `+0xDF3`/`+0xDF4` the ground latches and
///   `+0xE04` the input latch.
