/// Writes the position and up to eight state words, may play the burst/splash
/// stages and may switch to `0x80B737B8` through the `+0xD4` slot.
///
/// # Safety
/// The actor, its class vtable and the two `main.dol` manager objects must be
/// live.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the single `qr3` site is the `(f32)(u16)` widen pinned by
/// `docs/REL_ELF_MAPPING.md`; every other branch, step and constant is literal.
/// The export's `+0xE04 != 0 || +0xDF4 == 0` test is kept (the specification's
/// "and" reading is wrong; `0x80A873C0` carries the identical branch).
