// --- 128c.7 `0x80AADC50` `daEnKild_c` follower integration -------------------

/// Integrates the `daEnKild_c` follower chain and retires it after 600 frames.
///
/// The two body angles advance by `0x1000` (a quarter turn) and both body sway
/// values advance by the seed. `0x80AAD680` restarts a sway that crossed zero.
/// The lateral speeds decay by `0.21875` down to `-4.0`, then the body chain and
/// every twelve-byte segment integrate their sway, and the `+0xE36` frame timer
/// retires the actor through `0x80064D10`.
///
