/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80aadc50` at `0x80AADC50` (628 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80aadc50_FUN_80aadc50.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: the `daEnKild_c` follower; `+0xD54`/`+0xD5A` the body angles,
///   `+0xBA0..+0xBB4` the body chain, `+0xC78..+0xC8C` its sway pair,
///   `+0xDF8` the sway seed, `+0xE20` the segment count, `+0xE36` the retire
///   timer, `+0x390` the retire flag, `+0xD60` the six-byte segment angles.
///
