// --- 128c.8 `0x80AF2CF0` four-player colour/position marker publisher --------

/// Publishes one colour/position marker per live, non-flagged player slot.
///
/// For all four slots the body skips a missing player, a player carrying flag
/// `125`, and an empty `+0xB4C` byte. A live slot copies the player's x/y with a
/// fixed `5500.0` z, selects one of four colour pairs from that player's
/// `+0x14D4` mode, and hands both pairs to the two effect objects at `+0x8FC` and
