///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: the marker actor; `+0xB4C` the four slot bytes, `+0x8FC`/`+0xA24`
///   the two effect objects.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Six virtual calls per live slot and one position copy.
///
/// # Safety
/// Both effect objects, their vtables and the player table must be live.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - the four colour words, both descriptor strings and the three virtual
/// slots are literal. The colour mode is read from the player, not the actor:
/// the raw stream loads it through `r31`, which the loop sets to the player
/// object at `0x80AF2D5C` (`docs/SPEC_WAVE145_ENEMIES.md` has this as `this`).
