/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80b115a0` at `0x80B115A0` (480 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80b115a0_FUN_80b115a0.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: the actor; `+0xAC..+0xB4` position, `+0x100`/`+0x102`/`+0x104`
///   pitch/yaw/roll, `+0x348` side, `+0x484` render-item builder.
