// --- 130c.3 `0x80A99360` side-dependent hurt scale --------------------------

/// Recomputes the `+0xE8`/`+0xF4` scale pair from the actor's height.
///
/// The body stores `-0.375` at `+0x114`, reads the height above ground through
/// [`fn_80a98dc0`], and picks `0.5` or `1.0` from the `+0x5FE` variant and the
/// `1.5`/`2.5` height thresholds. The result is multiplied by the signed
/// per-side byte at `0x8042C1A0 + side` and written to both `+0xE8` and
/// `+0xF4`; `+0x118` is set to `-2.0`.
