// ===========================================================================
// 132. Wave 150 (`d_enemiesNP`, synthetic base 0x80A00000)
// ===========================================================================
//
// Twelve bodies of `docs/SPEC_WAVE149_ENEMIES.md` - the eleven "ready" rows
// plus the "conditional" `0x80B2A360`, whose only open item was the meaning of
// two `main.dol` field groups; the comparisons and the arithmetic are exact, so
// the two roles are carried as `// inferred:` instead of being left blank - four
// of the six remaining bodies of the `0x80B20000` planner bucket
// (`0x80B20010..0x80B28100`; the other two are skipped, see item 132 in the
// module header), and four rows below the specification's size cut. Every body
// was decoded from `work/rels/elf/d_enemiesNP.elf` through the `PT_LOAD` mapping
// of `docs/REL_ELF_MAPPING.md`; sizes are the `size` column of
// `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/functions.tsv`.
//
// Two specification/export readings were corrected against the raw stream and
// are called out at the affected body: `0x80AC8850` scales by `other+0xE8`
// (not `this+0xE8`), and `0x80B23890`'s record keeps the clip-name pointer that
// the export drops.

// --- 132a. Wave-150 constants -----------------------------------------------

/// Effect-display spawn `(object, player, row, flags, extra)` (`main.dol`).
const W150_FN_800D8BB0: usize = 0x800D_8BB0;
/// Predicted-position neighbour query `(actor, &out) -> actor|0` (`main.dol`).
const W150_FN_8006CED0: usize = 0x8006_CED0;
/// Short rotation setter `(amount in f1, target)` - pitch (`main.dol`).
const W150_FN_8012F810: usize = 0x8012_F810;
/// Short rotation setter `(amount in f1, target)` - lateral (`main.dol`).
const W150_FN_8012F8E0: usize = 0x8012_F8E0;
/// Game-mode code (`main.dol`); the value `1` skips the band scan.
const W150_FN_8005FFB0: usize = 0x8005_FFB0;
/// Starts one display node (`main.dol`).
const W150_FN_800D7980: usize = 0x800D_7980;
/// Stops one display node (`main.dol`).
const W150_FN_800D79B0: usize = 0x800D_79B0;
/// Scene-node mode setter `(node, mode, flag)` (`main.dol`).
const W150_FN_8016A0F0: usize = 0x8016_A0F0;
/// Animation element value `(holder, index) -> f32` (`main.dol`).
