/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a638f0` at `0x80A638F0` (284 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a638f0_FUN_80a638f0.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
