/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a00d00_FUN_80a00d00.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: the carrying actor; `+0x92E..0x931` the four carry markers,
///   `+0xAC`/`+0xB0`/`+0xB4` its position.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes the position of up to four player objects and clears their carry
/// markers. Constants come from `0x80B2A850` (`3.0`), `0x80B2A854` (`0.0`),
/// `0x80B2A86C` (`17.0`) and `0x80B2A870` (`2.0`).
///
/// # Safety
