/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80ab1780` at `0x80AB1780` (172 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80ab1780_FUN_80ab1780.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: the actor; `+0x540` the animation bank, `+0x544` the shared
