/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a92f40` at `0x80A92F40` (1172 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a92f40_FUN_80a92f40.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: the chaser; `+0x60` vtable, `+0xAC/B0/B4` position,
///   `+0xDC/E0/E4` scale, `+0xE8/EC` velocity pair, `+0xF4` turn step,
///   `+0x102` angle, `+0x114/118/11C` facing quartet, `+0x348` facing byte,
///   `+0x548` child object, `+0x70C` "attached" word and `+0x726` player index.
///
/// # Side effects
