///   the `+0xE92` halfword step and, when the clip pointer is already at the end
///   marker, plays the landing sound `0x1E2`, the `Wm_en_landsmoke_s` effect and
///   advances the pair/row ladder (`+0xEA1` toggle, `+0xEA2`/`+0xEA3` swap,
///   `+0x348` flip) before rebinding the animation;
/// * while `+0xE9E == 0`, runs the clip/landing machine `+0xEA6` times, which
///   either plays the next name of the current list, or, once the timing cursor
///   reaches the end marker, asks [`fn_80a7ab90`] whether the ladder can advance
///   and rebinds the start clip of the newly selected record;
/// * otherwise counts `+0xE9E` down and only refreshes the matrix.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80a7bec0` at `0x80A7BEC0` (1464 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_enemiesNP/export/80a7bec0_FUN_80a7bec0.c`
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80A00000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Removed: the modelled `_savegpr_19` prologue call (`0x802DCD54`); `r3` is
///   the incoming walker (`mr r23,r3`), not a helper return.
///
/// # Arguments
