///   `0x800AE500` (slot 160), so 12 zero bytes follow.
/// - Table: slot 158 of the `0x80314060` vtable (word `0x803142E0`, offset
///   `+0x280`).
/// - observed: `lwz r4,r3+0x760` / `cmpi 0` / `lwz r4,r4+0` / `cmpi 0` guard;
///   `addi r3,r3,0x600` / `bl 0x8023A0B0`; `addi r3,r31,0x644` /
///   `addi r4,r31,0x604` / `addi r5,r1,8` / `li r6,0` / `bl 0x801651F0`;
///   `lfs f1,r2-0x6C6C` / `r3=+0x604` / `r4=+0x644` / `bl 0x80169F80`;
///   `lfs f1,r2-0x6C70` / `r3=+0x644` / `bl 0x801680E0`.
/// - observed: `lfs f0,r2-0x6C6C` stored at `+0xE8`, `+0xEC` and `+0xF0`;
///   `addi r4,r31,0xAC` / `bl 0x80096240` / `stb r3,+0x348`;
///   `lwz r12,r31+0x60` / `lwz r12,r12+0x520` / `bcctr`;
///   `lbz r5,+0x348` / `lbzx r4,0x8042C1A0,r5` / `stw 1,+0x794` /
///   `extsb r0,r4` / `mullw r0,r0,r3` / `sth r0,+0x102`.
/// - Dispatcher: `lwz r12,r12+0x280` at `0x8001F83C`, `0x80022E74`,
///   `0x800230AC`, `0x8002B2C4`, `0x8002B3D8`, `0x8004F834`, `0x8004FB84`,
///   `0x8009EF2C`, `0x8013EC70`, `0x8013F908` and `0x8013FB8C`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: the actor. `+0x600` is the lookup manager, `+0x604` the owner
///   sub-object, `+0x644` the 0x38-byte element, `+0x760` the name-record
///   pointer, `+0x348` the side byte, `+0x102` the facing angle and `+0x794`
///   the mode word.
///
