/// two vtable calls and four actor stores.
///
/// # Safety
/// When `+0x760` and its target are non-null, `+0x600`, `+0x604` and `+0x644`
/// must be live display objects with the documented vtable slots; afterwards
/// `this + 0x60` must hold a callable `+0x520` entry.
