/// # Confidence
/// medium - every offset, guard, constant and call order is literal; the roles
/// of `+0x600`/`+0x604`/`+0x644` and the meaning of the `+0x520` multiplier are
/// inferred from the neighbouring display and `daEnCrow_c` bodies. The side
