/// Per-frame step: reset, motion, two timing hooks and an optional switch to
/// `0x80358244`.
///
/// Byte-identical twin of [`fn_800abf30`] (slot 236); only the relative `bl`
/// displacements differ. Same `+0x1C`/`0x8006CDE0`/`0x800955F0` opening as
/// [`fn_800ab920`], then class slot `+0x52C`, `0x800AA150`, and
/// `0x800AA620(this, 0x400)` - a fixed quarter-turn step rather than an angle
