///   `bcctr`; `bl 0x8006CDE0`; `bl 0x800955F0`; `lwz r12,r31+0x60` /
///   `lwz r12,r12+0x52C` / `bcctr`; `bl 0x800AA150`; `li r4,0x400` /
///   `bl 0x800AA620`; `addi r3,r31,0x1EC` / `bl 0x80072BC0` / `cmpi` /
///   `bc 12,2`; `lwz r12,r12+0xD4` / `lis r4,0x8036` / `addi r4,r4,-0x7DBC` /
///   `bcctr`.
/// - Dispatcher: `lwz r12,r12+0x3A0` at `0x800510C4` and `0x8014E9A4`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: actor with the `+0x604` clip holder, the `+0x1EC` physics object
///   and the `+0x60` class vtable.
///
/// # Returns
/// `0` when the `+0x1EC` probe answers zero (the epilogue keeps that `r3`),
/// otherwise the `+0xD4` switch answer.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One holder reset, two motion updates, two timing/angle steps and possibly one
/// state switch.
///
/// # Safety
/// The `+0x604` holder, the `+0x1EC` physics object and class slots
/// `+0x52C`/`+0xD4` must be live.
