///   and the `+0x60` class vtable.
///
/// # Returns
/// `0` when the `+0x1EC` probe answers zero, otherwise the `+0xD4` switch
/// answer.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One holder reset, two motion updates, two timing/angle steps and possibly one
/// state switch.
