/// The two-step per-frame action state machine (`+0x360` = `1` then `2`).
///
/// Common opening: the `+0x604` holder reset, a release of element `1` of the
/// `+0x67C` group when the `+0x758` record's `+0x10` word is live, the
/// `0x8006CDE0`/`0x800955F0` motion pair, the `+0x1EC` contact cut, the nearest
/// player index at `+0x764`, class `+0x480` kept as the support word, the
/// `0x800AA400` aim refresh and class `+0x578`.
