///   class `+0x4CC` / `stw r3,r30+0x770`, `lwz r3,r30+0x5F8` /
///   `lwz r12,0(r3)` / `lwz r12,r12+0x14` / `bcctr`, `lwz r0,r30+0x798` /
///   `cmpi 1`, class `+0x4A8` / `extsh` / `stw r0,r30+0x768`, else class
