///   `stw r0,r30+0x360`; in state 2 `lwz r3,r30+0x770` / `cmpi` / `li r4,0`
///   or `bl 0x80162D00` / `mr r4,r3`, `bl 0x800AA6A0`, `lwz r3,r30+0x768` /
///   `addic. r0,r3,-1` / `stw r0,r30+0x768` / `bc 12,1` to the epilogue,
///   `cmpi r31,0` / `bc 12,2` to the epilogue, and the `+0xD4` switch with
///   `-31932` = `0x80358344`.
