/// Builds a 0x1C-byte list entry and links it to the `+0x74` child.
///
/// The object is allocated through `0x802B9240(0x1C, heap, 4)` where the heap
/// is the SDA1 word `r13 - 0x524C` (`0x8042A434`). Its fields are
