///   `lwz r4,r13-0x524C`; `li r3,0x1C` / `li r5,4` / `bl 0x802B9240`;
///   `lis r4,0x8033` / `addi r4,r4,-0x6608` (vtable `0x80339A14`);
///   `bl 0x80296750`; `lwz r12,0(r25)` / `lwz r12,0xA4(r12)` / `bcctr`;
///   `bl 0x80296760`; the `0x80377C3C` insert; the `[r31+8]+8` delete arm.
